00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.150
Hey, when you made your debut...

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.190
Bye-bye!

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.310
Hey!

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.560
Huh?

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:57.150
Can you help me get down from here?

00:01:58.350 --> 00:01:59.440
Me?!

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:04.270
Yup! I was playing with the cat
and didn't notice how high we were.

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:06.980
Okay, so... Let me find a ladder or something...

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.480
Forget that! Just come over here!

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.940
Ready?

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.190
Here I come!

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:19.350
What?!

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.810
Light as a feather, right?

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.230
All righty then.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:34.020
I'm Mei Hayasaka, what's your name?

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.900
It's Makino...

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.940
Thanks Mr. Makino!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.230
Bye-bye to the girl, too!

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:43.270
The girl...?

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.600
What?!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.440
Let's eat!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.310
Suzu.

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:26.690
Huh?

00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:30.020
Do you have any material
on idols by any chance?

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.400
Like Miss Mana's?

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:34.060
Yeah, and other idols, too.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.440
They'd be useful references from here on out.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.190
Of course I do!

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:42.560
I have concert material exclusive to fan club
members only and clippings of featured articles!

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:43.850
Huh?

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.770
I'll bring mine, too.

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:48.060
Thanks.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.440
Miss Mana is hands down the best!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.650
The audience's reaction is incredible.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:05.600
This was when she broke
LizNoir's attendance record!

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.520
Big Sister...

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:11.230
I wonder what kind of lessons Miss Mana took.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.440
I would like to know as well!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.690
Kotono, you must know, don't you?

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:20.400
We didn't really talk about her work at home.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.560
Then let's ask Mr. Makino.

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:25.730
Before that, I want you all to watch this, too.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.020
They're...

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.350
They are TRINITYAiLE.

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.100
They've been really popular recently.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:48.650
Their popularity is split with
LizNoir as newcomer idols.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.770
Amazing. Compared to us...

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:55.060
It's like night and day.

00:05:56.810 --> 00:06:00.060
That means they're also...

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.600
Our rivals...

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.310
Huh? What Mana did for lessons?

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.060
Yes. We'd like to know as a reference.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.440
Well, let's see...

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:14.980
She'd do basic training and
sing at the station regularly...

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:19.650
And she would work with a professional coach
a few times a week...

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.150
A professional coach?!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.100
Maybe...

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:23.480
Could that be it?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.650
We would like to take
the same lessons, too!

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.850
Trust me, I know.

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.440
I'm in the process of arranging it right now.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:34.270
What else?

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:35.520
What else...?

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.480
Well...?

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:41.770
I did take lessons seriously...

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:44.230
But before I knew it,
I was already popular.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.600
Just give me some time to remember.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:51.850
For now, focus on mastering the basics.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:53.550
I am curious about everything!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:54.100
Yeah.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.520
A professional coach.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:56.810
I wonder what it's like.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.560
Kotono...?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.310
Do you think we can surpass today's LizNoir

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:05.310
and TRINITYAiLE if we work harder
than my sister did back then?

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.900
Please be honest with me.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.060
I don't know.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:12.900
They're evolving as idols every day.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:15.940
The fans' expectations are
constantly getting higher, too.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:20.310
But you were all chosen carefully
by Mr. Saegusa and myself.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:22.940
You all have just as much potential as they do.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.270
And...

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.650
And?

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:30.900
I'll think about it, too.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.480
Please do.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.440
A potential new member?

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:40.600
Yeah.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:45.480
Kotono prompted me to think about it,
and this vague idea came to me...

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.020
Our group, right now...

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.730
"Is missing something."

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:50.980
How did you know?

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:54.400
Who do you think I am?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.060
The balance of the members isn't too bad.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:00.480
They've been clearing every criterion
on their path to make their debut.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.480
It's just that...

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.810
"They're too perfect"?

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.150
You think so, too?

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:09.440
I don't feel any kind of
anxiety watching them.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.850
While that's a good thing,

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.980
the popular idols I knew

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:17.020
would all somehow keep
everyone in suspense.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.650
It all started with you, you know?

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:19.940
What?

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.400
A little erratic...

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.230
Huh?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.350
What is it?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:28.350
I felt that feeling somewhere recently...

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:29.730
Oh, yeah.

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:33.600
Are you about to scout
that girl from the other day?

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:37.900
I haven't decided yet, but I thought
it wouldn't hurt to see her again.

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:41.350
Do you really think she'd
conveniently be at the same--

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.770
There she is.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.190
Hey!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.020
Huh?

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.770
Mr. Makino!

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.310
Playing with a cat again?

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:51.440
Nope!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.850
Today it's something even more impressive!

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:56.150
Come on Mr. Makino, I'll show you!

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.310
Whoa.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.400
Be careful, it's dangerous.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.900
So, what's there to see?

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.060
That!

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.690
Pretty cool, right?

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:25.810
Yeah, do you know her?

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:26.770
Nope.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:28.420
Never spoken to her.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:28.980
What?

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.600
But I do know her name!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.690
It's Rei Ichinose!

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.810
Rei Ichinose...

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:41.480
I heard she won the high school
dance competition.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.770
She amazes me so much,

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.690
so I watch her all the time.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:46.690
All the time?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.520
Yup!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.270
Hey, be careful!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.600
I'm totally fine!

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:54.940
I've got a great sense of balance.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:59.400
I wonder if I'd be able to
dance like her if I practiced.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.190
Do you like to dance?

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:04.480
Yeah!

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:05.810
It makes me feel like

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:08.520
I can become something sparkly!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.650
Miss Mei Hayasaka.

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:14.850
What's up?

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:19.060
You might be surprised at the sudden--

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:19.060
Hello? Is this the police?

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.350
Yes.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:23.730
A suspicious man is speaking to a girl wearing
a school uniform on top of the wall.

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:24.690
That's not good!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.020
Huh?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.520
Hey! Wait up!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.940
Did she report you?

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:35.150
Most likely.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.690
We probably shouldn't be together right now.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.440
But you wanted to talk to me, right?

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:43.730
You were just about to say something.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.350
That's right.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:48.850
Miss Mei Hayasaka.

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.100
Yes?

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:53.810
Would you be interested in becoming an idol?

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.600
Sure thing!

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:06.730
<i>Idoly Pride.</i>

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.270
A new member...?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.480
Yeah.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.730
Come on in.

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.650
Hello there!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.520
I'm Mei Hayasaka,
a first-year at Hoshimi High!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:23.310
Good to meet you!

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.520
Likewise.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.400
Nice to meet you.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.980
Mr. Makino, may I have a word?

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:32.560
What is going on?

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:35.690
I was never told about a new member.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.190
Because I never said anything.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.520
Mr. Makino.

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.100
Kotono...

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.600
I said I would think about it, remember?

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:45.520
And you came up with adding a new member?

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:48.940
To my eyes, I think this group
is still incomplete.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:54.770
Who knows, more members
could be added at any time.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.190
Possibly for another...

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:02.900
I'm doing my best to figure out
what we're lacking.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:06.730
Are you saying she has something we lack?

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:09.060
That's what I thought.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:12.560
Anyway, it's Mei's first day.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.560
I'm counting on you all to help her.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:15.900
Will do.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:38.770
Hey, hey!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:42.100
The group name isn't decided yet, right?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:45.270
I came up with a good one!

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:49.270
Introducing! Mei Donuts!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.900
Why did you choose donuts...?

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:55.230
Because I love them!

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.560
Oh, yeah!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.020
I'm moving into the dorms today, too.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:02.690
Maybe I'll move into
the same room as Mr. Makino!

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:05.020
Mr. Makino...?

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.020
No...!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:07.560
C-Come on, Mei.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:08.520
You can't joke like that--

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.350
Why are you getting all embarrassed?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:13.560
We've already had a date
on top of the wall.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:14.560
A date?

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.850
No! Wait!

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.980
What are you calling a date?!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:19.980
Mr. Makino.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.520
Yes?

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:23.270
May I have a word?

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.600
Mei was just joking.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:29.150
I know that.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.980
She is a cute girl.

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:34.190
She's cheerful and has good style.

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:37.810
She does seem suited to becoming an idol.

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:42.350
Mr. Makino, does this mean
you think we lack those things?

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:45.020
No, not at all.

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:49.850
I felt it was necessary to change the air.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:52.730
I don't understand.

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:58.730
But I think this is what it
means to "change the air."

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.480
I didn't mean to cause all this tension.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.270
Long day?

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:05.850
Miss Haruko...

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:07.770
How is the new girl?

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:12.020
Since it was pretty abrupt,
everyone's a bit flustered.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:16.190
Don't worry, I'm sure they'll
manage to get along soon.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:21.520
I heard it was a wooden structure,
so I assumed it'd be old...

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:23.020
But this is nice!

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.190
What were you imagining?

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:29.940
Do you make the food, Nagisa?

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:31.350
We all take turns.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:33.940
It's chicken <i>karaage</i> !

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.190
I love chicken <i>karaage</i> !

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:37.400
That's great!

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:39.400
I made a lot, so eat up.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.060
Will do!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.060
All right, make sure
you fill out the profile section.

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:46.020
Got it.

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:47.520
I'm jealous!

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:50.310
The combination of crispy skin and tender meat!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.600
The juices flow out when you bite into it!

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:53.940
That exactly!

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:55.600
Can't wait to eat it!

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.350
Yeah! What?

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.350
What?

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:01.310
Could it be that... You see me?

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.190
Yup, sure can!

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:04.600
What do you see?

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.810
Right next to Mr. Makino--

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:09.020
Wait! Mei! Come over here!

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:15.310
Mei, so...

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.440
Do you really see her?

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.810
Sure do.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.810
Are you really, really sure?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.730
Yup!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.100
I really, really do!

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:26.850
She really does!

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:29.020
I can finally talk to a girl!

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:30.650
I'm so happy!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:34.730
Imagine only being able
to talk to this guy for years!

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:35.850
Oh, wow.

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:38.150
We've run out of topics to talk about.

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:39.440
Liar.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.150
Hey, can I ask your name?

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.350
I'm Mana Nagase.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:48.190
You're Kotono's big sister, right?

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.810
That's right.

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:51.810
You both look alike!

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.440
Why are you able to see Mana, Mei?

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:58.400
It's a disposition... that's been
passed down in the family...?

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:00.600
Wonder if that's the case with me, too.

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:05.270
I doubt it...

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.060
But anyway, Mei...

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:10.060
Could you keep this a secret from everyone?

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.850
Yup, I know.

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:14.810
I would be called a liar all the time.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.100
I see...

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.650
Right.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:21.350
That's what it would mean
to see something others can't.

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:23.310
Hey!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:26.150
Does this mean I can pop over all the time now?

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.020
What?

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:30.940
Let's chat about all sorts
of things from here on out!

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:34.060
Yeah!

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:41.230
The chicken <i>karaage</i> was yummy!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:44.770
Thanks for showing me to the bath, Sakura!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.850
Sure thing.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.980
We take baths in pairs,

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.310
and when we're done,
we get the next pair.

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:51.810
Gotcha!

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:56.100
So Mei, what were you and
Mr. Makino talking about earlier?

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:58.770
It's a secret.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.440
What? I'm so curious.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.400
Oh?

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:05.690
Sakura... Your chest...

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:06.980
Oh, this?

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:08.440
It's a scar from my surgery.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:09.940
Surgery?

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:10.810
Yup.

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:13.480
But I'm all better now!

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.400
I see.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.230
The bath is open.

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.150
Okay!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:23.270
All right! Time to go play!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.520
Where to?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.310
It's a secret!

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.100
Suzu- <i>nyan</i> ! The bath is open!

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.190
Okay, thank you.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.520
Suzu- <i>nyan</i> ?

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:50.020
I wonder where she's off to?

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.100
She disappears a lot after the bath.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:55.270
Is she... going out at night?

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:59.690
Judging from her attire,
the furthest she'd be is Makino's room.

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.100
Mr. Makino's...

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.520
...Room?!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.350
Come on, hurry!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.270
I can hear Mei's voice.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:11.270
Just go with your intuition!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:13.690
An idol and manager's
secret rendezvous?!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:18.100
You can't look anymore!
I can't keep a straight face.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.730
I have read it in novels before!

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:18.100
I wonder what they're doing.

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:19.230
Hurry up.

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:20.400
Anyway, this is imprudent.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:22.560
I know! Now it's payback!

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:22.560
We need to speak up to Mr. Makino.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.560
Is it this one?

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.690
No, this one!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:30.020
Are you sure about that?

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.670
Mr. Makino?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.600
Huh?

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:36.060
Is Mei in your room?

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:38.270
No... Wait a minute!

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.650
Kotono!

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:44.520
What's the matter?

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:46.150
What are you doing?

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:47.060
Um...

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:50.850
Mei wanted to know more about Mana,
so I was showing her.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:51.940
Oh, really?

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.100
Shh.

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:55.150
That video!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:58.730
It is the unreleased footage of
Miss Mana's legendary concert!

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.560
Sh-Shall we all watch it together?

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:01.810
Yes, please!

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:11.520
Yup! It looks better this way!

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:14.100
Your ideas are great, Mei.

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:17.310
Incorporating them really makes
the choreography fun.

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:20.850
Dancing is something fun in the first place.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:23.310
It's not because of me.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.190
Kotono...

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:40.150
I feel like I kind of get what you mean
by how Mei changes the air.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.020
How so?

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:46.600
Before she came,
the lessons felt somewhat tense.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:49.900
But because of her, that's changed.

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:53.230
Everyone has been voicing
their opinions more than before.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:54.900
We're all smiling more.

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:56.730
That's a good thing.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:00.100
I was the one who caused the tension before.

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:05.520
Everyone must've felt my frustration
over wanting to catch up to my sister.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:08.020
That was necessary, too.

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:11.310
That tension heightened everyone's awareness.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:14.850
It's not about who's right or wrong.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:18.440
There are times when coming together
makes things better or worse.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.600
What do you think I should do?

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:28.350
Don't hesitate and push forward
as yourself, Kotono.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:31.190
You're the engine for everyone, Kotono.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.350
I am...?

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.940
This takes me back!

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:54.850
My monumental debut concert stage!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:58.100
I'm going to have them start here, too.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:20:59.940
Sounds good to me.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.690
But you're still unsure about something.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:04.100
Yeah.

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:06.060
Let me guess.

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:10.980
You're unsure who to designate as
the leader--Kotono or Sakura, right?

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:12.600
That's right.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.480
We've known each other too long,
don't you think?

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:20.440
Mana, who would you choose?

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:23.900
That's your job, right, Makino?

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.770
Indeed.

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:29.400
But I've got a bit of advice for you.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:33.480
Makino... Have more faith in your intuition!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:37.350
You used to be the manager
for <i>the</i> Mana Nagase.

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:38.810
Mana...

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:42.100
You've already made up your mind, right?

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:49.160
Raise the Volume More and More

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:46.770
Yeah.

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:25.100
Your debut is set.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:30.440
From here on out, we'll be tailoring
your lessons towards that end.

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.650
I'll keep you informed about the details.

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:34.650
But before that, Sakura...

00:23:34.650 --> 00:23:36.730
Yes?

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:40.270
I'm going to have you leave this group.

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:45.850
What...?
